# Obsidian vault (Rah's local docs, not part of the repo)
# Added 19 August 2026. The vault lives at ~/Desktop/jobSearchClaude/jobSearchClaude/
# so it does not show up as untracked in git status and never gets pushed.

# Obsidian workspace metadata (per-machine, do not track)
# The vault CONTENT (markdown notes + attachments/) IS tracked, so it gets
# GitHub backup and history. Only the workspace UI state stays local.
.obsidian/
.obsidian_workspace
jobSearchClaude/.obsidian/
jobSearchClaude/.obsidian_workspace
jobSearchClaude/.trash/
